# Windows lit of an evening (reports/render-features/2026-11-15-night-interiors, step 1): the market house, whose
# fachwerk panels carry closed shutters (NW_CITY_WINDOW_03) and whose plinth has small openings
# (NW_CITY_FACHWERKBASEMENT_WINDOW_01). The views of market-house.bench, each at noon, through the evening and at
# night: no glow by day and at sunset (21:00), the windows come up one after another from 21:15, burn at 22:30 and
# are out by 00:30.
# Run with OPENGOTHIC_CONTENT=<a folder made by scripts/content/window_glow.py pilot>; with the working content the
# same shots show the house without the glow.
# @timeout 420
cheat god
overlay off
view hide animated morph
cam lift off



# front
set time 12 0
cam look -1240
goto pos 9137 2000 3745
cam world 1650 -1560 24.462
wait 34
cam hold
wait 6000
set time 12 0
wait 3500
shot front-1200
wait 300
set time 21 0
wait 3500
shot front-2100
wait 300
set time 21 45
wait 3500
shot front-2145
wait 300
set time 22 30
wait 3500
shot front-2230
wait 300
set time 23 30
wait 3500
shot front-2330
wait 300
set time 0 30
wait 3500
shot front-0030
wait 300
set time 2 0
wait 3500
shot front-0200
wait 300

